# This directory's only real content is active-theme.yaml, a symlink
# repointed by bin/bin/theme and matched by .gitignore's active-theme.*
# rule — so without this file git wouldn't track the directory at all,
# it wouldn't exist after a clean clone, and `ln -sfr` into a missing
# directory fails silently (bin/bin/theme is deliberately -uo pipefail,
# not -e). Exactly the bug the qt5ct/qt6ct colors/ directories hit on
# the second machine; see CLAUDE.md's clean-machine findings.
